   "id": 0,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 1924,
   "end": 1957,
   "text": "# NVIDIA IsaacLab Arena & LeRobot",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 1959,
   "end": 2191,
   "text": "LeRobot EnvHub now supports **GPU-accelerated simulation** with IsaacLab Arena for policy evaluation at scale.\nTrain and evaluate imitation learning policies with high-fidelity simulation — all integrated into the LeRobot ecosystem.",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 2437,
   "end": 2542,
   "text": "[IsaacLab Arena](⟦0⟧) integrates with NVIDIA IsaacLab to provide:",
   "tokens": [
    "https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab-Arena"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 2544,
   "end": 2618,
   "text": "- 🤖 **Humanoid embodiments**: GR1, G1, Galileo with various configurations",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 2619,
   "end": 2722,
   "text": "- 🎯 **Manipulation & loco-manipulation tasks**: Door opening, pick-and-place, button pressing, and more",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 2723,
   "end": 2802,
   "text": "- ⚡ **GPU-accelerated rollouts**: Parallel environment execution on NVIDIA GPUs",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 2803,
   "end": 2911,
   "text": "- 🖼️ **RTX Rendering**: Evaluate vision-based policies with realistic rendering, reflections and refractions",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 2912,
   "end": 3025,
   "text": "- 📦 **LeRobot-compatible datasets**: Ready for training with GR00T N1x, PI0, SmolVLA, ACT, and Diffusion policies",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "kind": "list",
   "start": 3026,
   "end": 3109,
   "text": "- 🔄 **EnvHub integration**: Load environments from HuggingFace EnvHub with one line",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 3111,
   "end": 3126,
