  },
  {
   "id": 72,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 13968,
   "end": 14406,
   "text": "[Lightwheel](⟦0⟧) is bringing ⟦1⟧ and ⟦2⟧ with 268 tasks to the LeRobot ecosystem.\nLW-BenchHub collects and generates large-scale datasets via teleoperation that comply with the LeRobot specification, enabling out-of-the-box training and evaluation workflows.\nWith the unified interface provided by EnvHub, developers can quickly build end-to-end experimental pipelines.",
   "tokens": [
    "https://www.lightwheel.ai",
    "`Lightwheel-Libero-Tasks`",
    "`Lightwheel-RoboCasa-Tasks`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 73,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 14408,
   "end": 14419,
   "text": "### Install",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 74,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 14421,
   "end": 14517,
   "text": "Assuming you followed the [Installation](⟦0⟧) steps, you can install LW-BenchHub with:",
   "tokens": [
    "#installation"
   ]
  },
